'''Eternalcane''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was released on December 6th, 2019, during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]] to promote [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] merch. It was originally obtainable by purchasing merch from [https://shopmm2.com shopmm2.com]<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/1203089321013776385 
</ref> and redeeming the promotional code that came with it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended and the merch has since sold out.

==Appearance==
It has a long, slightly jagged red and white candy cane textured blade with a scratched silver edge. The guard is silver with curved quillons, two sets of horns by the ricasso, and glowing red eyes. The handle, attached to a silver prong below the guard, is gray with a silver paracord wrap that has glowing red beads on it.

==Trivia== 
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Lugercane]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Eternalcane Set|Eternalcane Set]].
*Eternalcane is one of the many candy cane themed godlies, others being [[Lugercane]], [[Minty]], [[Peppermint]], [[Candy]], and [[Sugar]].
*It is currently the only holiday themed Eternal knife.
*It is currently the most valuable of the Eternals.
*It has been a major target in duping.
*The other Eternals, which were obtained in a similar way, are [[Eternal]], [[Eternal II]], [[Eternal III]], and [[Eternal IV]].
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/532254782/Sword-of-the-Eternal-Abyss Sword of the Eternal Abyss].

